hadiths[157]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1290","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Amr ibn Shuayb from his father from his father's father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1291","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1292","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm that Aban ibn Uthman and Hisham ibn Ismail used to mention in their khutbas built-in liability agreements in the sale of slaves"
"1293","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar sold one of his slaves for eight hundred dirhams with the stipulation that he was not responsible for defects. The person who bought the slave complained to Abdullah ibn Umar that the slave had a disease which he had not told him about. They argued and went to Uthman ibn Affan for a decision . The man said"
"1294","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud told him that Abdullah ibn Masud bought a slave-girl from his wife"
"1295","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would say"
"1296","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Abdullah ibn Amir gave Uthman ibn Affan a slave-girl who had a husband whom he had purchased at Basra. Uthman said"
"1297","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf bought a slave- girl and found that she had a husband"
"1298","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1299","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1300","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil from Anas ibn Malik that the Messenger of Allah"
"1301","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Haritha from his mother"
"1302","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Kharija ibn Zayd ibn Thabit that Zayd ibn Thabit did not sell fruit until the Pleiades were visible"
"1303","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar from Zayd ibn Thabit that the Messenger of Allah"
"1304","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from Abu Sufyan"
"1305","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman heard his mother"
"1306","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz decided in a case to make a reduction for crop damage. Malik said"
"1307","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abd ar-Rahman that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad would sell produce from his orchard and keep some of it aside"
"1308","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr that his grandfather"
"1309","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'r-Rijal"
"1310","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ata ibn Yasar said"
"1311","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd al-Hamid ibn Suhayl ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf from Said ibn al-Musayyab from Abu Said al- Khudri and from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1312","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Yazid that Zayd ibn Ayyash told him that he had once asked Sad ibn Abi Waqqas about selling white wheat for a type of good barley. Sad asked him which was the better and when he told him the white wheat"
"1313","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1314","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from Abu Sufyan"
"1315","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1316","Malik said"
"1317","Yahya related to me from Malik from Musa ibn Abi Tamim from Abu'l Hubab Said ibn Yasar from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1318","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abu Said al-Khudri that the Messenger of Allah"
"1319","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki that Mujahid said"
"1320","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from his grandfather"
"1321","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan sold a gold or silver drinking- vessel for more than its weight. Abu'dDarda said"
"1322","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1323","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1324","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Oasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1325","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'z-Zinad heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1326","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1327","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Malik ibn Aus ibn al-Hadathan an-Nasri that one time he asked to exchange 100 dinars. He said"
"1328","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt saw Said ibn al-Musayyab sell gold counterpoising for gold. He poured his gold into one pan of the scales"
"1329","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1330","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1331","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1332","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Hakim ibn Hizam traded in food for people as Umar ibn al-Khattab had ordered him to do. Hakim re-sold the food before he had taken delivery of it. That reached Umar ibn al-Khattab and he revoked the sale and said"
"1333","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that receipts were given to people in the time of Marwan ibn al-Hakam for the produce of the market at al-Jar. People bought and sold the receipts among themselves before they took delivery of the goods. Zayd Thabit and one of the Companions of the Messenger of Allah"
"1334","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man wanted to buy food from a man in advance. The man who wanted to sell the food to him went with him to the market"
"1335","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Jamil ibn Abd ar-Rahman the Muadhdhin say to Said ibn al-Musayyab"
"1336","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'z-Zinad heard Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab andSulayman ibn Yasar forbid a man to sell wheat for gold on delayed terms and then to buy dried dates with the gold before he had taken delivery of the gold"
"1337","Yahya related to me from Malik that Kathir ibn Farqad asked Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm about a man who sold food to be delivered at a future date to a man for gold and then with the gold"
"1339","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that there was no harm in a man making an advance to another man for food"
"1340","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1341","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Sulayman ibn Yasar told him that one time the fodder of the animals of Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Aswad ibn Abd Yaghuth was finished so he said to his slave"
"1342","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard the same as that from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad from Ibn Muayqib ad-Dawsi. Malik said"
"1343","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Maryam asked Said ibn al-Musayyab's advice. ""I am a man who buys food with receipts from al-Jar. Perhaps I will buy something for a dinar and half a dirham"
"1344","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Muhammad Sirin used to say"
"1345","Malik said"
"1346","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yunus ibn Yusuf from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab passed by Hatab ibn Abi Baltaa who was underselling some of his raisins in the market. Umar ibn al- Khattab said to him"
"1347","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Uthman ibn Affan forbade hoarding"
"1348","Yahya related to me from Malik from Salih ibn Kaysan from Hasan ibn Muhammad ibn Ali ibn Abi Talib that Ali ibn Abi Talib sold one of his camels called Usayfir for 20 camels to be delivered later"
"1349","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar bought a female riding-camel for four camels and he guaranteed to give them in full to the buyer at ar-Rabadha"
"1350","Yahya related to me that Malik asked Ibn Shihab about selling animals"
"1351","Yahya related to me from Malih from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1352","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"1353","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Said ibn al-Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1354","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that he heard Said ibn alMusayyab say"
"1355","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"1356","Malik said"
"1357","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1358","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1359","Malik said"
"1360","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man said to another"
"1361","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad was asked about a man who bought goods for 10 dinars cash or fifteen dinars on credit. He disapproved of that and forbade it. Malik said that if a man bought goods from a man for either 10 dinars or 15 dinars on credit"
"1362","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar from Said ibn al-Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1363","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban and from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1364","Yahya related to me"
"1365","Malik related to me that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Masud used to relate that the Messenger of Allah"
"1366","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Busr ibn Said from Ubayd"
"1367","Yahya related to me from Malik from Uthman ibn Hafs ibn Khalda from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar was asked about a man who took a loan from another man for a set term. The creditor reduced the debt"
"1368","Malik related to me that Zayd ibn Aslam said"
"1369","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1370","Malik related to me from Musa ibn Maysara that he heard a man ask Said ibn al-Musayyab"
"1371","Malik said there was no harm if a man who sold some drapery and excluded some garments by their markings"
"1372","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from Umar ibn Abdal-Aziz from Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1373","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Abu Rafi"
"1374","Malik related to me from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki that Mujahid said"
"1375","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab said that he disapproved of one man lending another food on the provision that he gave it back to him in another city. He said"
"1376","And Malik related to me that he had heard that a man came to Abdullah ibn Umar and said"
"1377","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that he heard Abdullah ibn Umar say"
"1378","Malik related to me that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Masud used to say"
"1379","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1380","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1381","Malik said"
"1382","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that a man mentioned to the Messenger of Allah"
"1383","Malik related to me that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al- Musayyab say"
"1384","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that he heard Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir say"
"1385","Malik related to me that he asked Ibn Shihab about a man who hired an animal"
"1386","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that his father said"
"1387","Malik related to me from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman from his father from his father that Uthman ibn Affan gave him some money as qirad to use provided the profit was shared between them"
"1388","Malik said"
"1391","Malik related to me that Ibn Shihab said"
"1392","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab that he asked Salim ibn 'Abdullah ibn Umar about renting out fields. He said"
"1393","Malik related to me that he had heard that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf rented land"
"1394","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father used to rent out his land for gold and silver. Malik was asked about a man who rented his field for 100 sa of dates or part of its produce of wheat or from other than its produce. He disapproved of that"
"1395","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab and from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf that the Messenger of Allah"
"1396","Malik said"
"1397","Malik related to me that he heard the like of that from Sulayman ibn Yasar. Malik spoke about a man who bought out one of the partners in a shared property"
"1398","Yahya said that Malik related from Muhammad ibn Umara from Abu Bakr ibn Hazm that Uthman ibn Affan said"
"1399","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from Zaynab bint Abi Salama from Umm Salama"
"1400","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab had a dispute brought to him between a muslim and a jew. Umar saw that the right belonged to the jew and decided in his favour. The jew said to him"
"1401","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from his father from Abdullah ibn Amr ibn Uthman from Abu Amra al-Ansari from Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani that the Messenger of Allah"
"1402","Malik related to me that Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman said"
"1403","Malik related to me that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1404","Yahya said from Malik that he heard from Sulayman ibn Yasar and others that when they were asked whether the testimony of a man flogged for a hadd crime was permitted"
"1405","Hadith Translation Not available"
"1406","Yahya said"
"1407","From Malik from Abu'z-Zinad that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz wrote to Abd al-Hamid ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Zayd ibn al-Khattab who was the governor of Kufa"
"1408","Malik related to me that he heard that Abu Salama ibn Abd ar- Rahman and Sulayman ibn Yasar were both asked"
"1409","Yahya said that Malik spoke about a man who died and had a debt owing to him and there was one witness"
"1410","Yahya said"
"1411","Yahya said"
"1412","Malik related to me from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman from Mabad ibn Kab as-Salami from his brother Abdullah ibn Kab ibn Malik al-Ansari from Abu Umama that the Messenger of Allah"
"1413","Yahya said that Malik had said from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that he heard Abu Ghatafan ibn Tarif al-Muriyi say"
"1414","Yahya said"
"1415","Yahya said"
"1416","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1417","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Qari that his father said"
"1418","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih as- Samman from his father from Abu Hurayra that Sad ibn Ubada said to the Messenger of Allah"
"1419","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that a Syrian man called Ibn Khaybari found a man with his wife and killed him"
"1420","Yahya said that Malik related from Ibn Shihab that Sunayn Abi Jamila"
"1421","Yahya said from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr that A'isha"
"1422","Malik related to me from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn al-Hadi from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith at-Taymi from Sulayman ibn Yasar from Abdullah ibn Abi Umayya that a woman's husband died"
"1423","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Umar ibn al-Khattab used to attach the children of the Jahiliyya to whoever claimed them in Islam. Two men came and each of them claimed a woman's child. Umar ibn al-Khattab summoned a person who scrutinized features and he looked at them. The scrutinizer said"
"1424","Malik related to me that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab or Uthman ibn Affan gave a judgement about a slave woman who misled a man about herself and said that she was free. He married her and she bore children. It was decided that he should ransom his children with their like of slaves. Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1425","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1426","Malik related to me from Nafi that Safiyya bint Abi Ubayd informed him that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1427","Yahya related from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1428","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah from his father that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1429","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1430","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1431","Malik related to me from Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman from his mother Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that she informed him that the Messenger of Allah"
"1432","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1433","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1434","Malik related to me from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini from his father that ad-Dahhak ibn Khalifa watered his irrigation ditch from a large source of water. He wanted to have it pass through the land of Muhammad ibn Maslama"
"1435","Malik related to me from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini that his father said"
"1436","Yahya related to me from Malik that Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili said"
"1437","Yahya said that he heard Malik speak about a man who died and left properties in Aliya and Safila (outlying districts of Madina). He said"
"1438","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from Yahya ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Hatib that some slaves of Hatib stole a she-camel belonging to a man from the Muzayna tribe and they slaughtered it. The case was brought before Umar ibn al-Khattab"
"1439","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1440","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr that A'isha"
"1441","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abd al-Qari that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1442","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1443","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1444","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim ibn Muhammad heard Makhul ad-Dimashqi ask al-Qasim ibn Muhammad about the life pension and what people said about it. Al- Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1445","Malik related to me from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar inherited the house of Hafsa bint Umar. He said"
"1446","Malik related to me from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from Yazid"
"1447","Malik related to me from Ayyub ibn Musa from Muawiya ibn Abdullah ibn Badr al-Juhani that his father informed him that he stopped with a people on the way to Syria and he found a purse which had eighty dinars in it. He mentioned that to Umar ibn al-Khattab. Umar said to him"
"1448","Malik related to me from Nafi that a man found something and went to Abdullah ibn Umar and said to him"
"1449","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"